# Terraform
# .terraform/ holds downloaded provider binaries - large, and re-created by `terraform init`.
# State files record the real IDs of everything Terraform manages and can contain
# secrets in plain text, so they must never be committed.
# Note that .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins exact provider
# versions so every machine resolves the same ones, and belongs in git.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log

# Scratch files from one-off az commands
fedcred*.json
